hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"67","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne — jabke wo khalifa the — mujhe bulawa bheja, phir kaha: Sa'id bin Khalid bin Amr bin Usman mere paas aaya, phir kaha: Aye Amirul Momineen, mujhe [zameen] As-Sadeer ata farmayen. Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se [ye] pahuncha hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Koi shakhs koi poda nahin lagata magar Allah use pode aur phal ki tadad ke barabar ajr deta hai.' Aur us ne mujh se pakad ki [takeed se poocha]: Kya tum ne ye suna hai? To main ne kaha: Ji han. Main Ata bin Yazid par gawahi deta hun ke unhon ne use Abu Ayub se suna jo use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte the."
